Normal selling price with 20% markup on cost:

If cost = 100, selling price = 120
So selling price = Cost × 1.20

For the damaged item:

Cost: 18.5k
Normal selling price = 18.5k × 1.20 = 22.2k
Less: Repair cost = 5.5k
NRV = 22.2k - 5.5k = 16.7k

Step 2: Value damaged item at lower of cost or NRV

Cost: 18.5k
NRV: 16.7k
Value at: 16.7k (lower)

Step 3: Total inventory value
Total inventory = 222.5k + 16.7k = 239.2k', 'hard', 'cmlavvqbm009gkoa3sx19b6ow', '2026-02-06T07:50:56.915Z', '2026-02-16T14:22:03.399Z', NULL, '[]');
